Third-party components
======================

1. captcha.ort (slider-captcha detector model)

   Source project : ChaoxingSignFaker
   Repository     : https://github.com/aquamarine5/ChaoxingSignFaker
   Source path    : app/src/main/assets/captcha.ort
   License        : GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPLv3)
   Upstream author: aquamarine5 / Brainspark (see repository)
   Modification   : unmodified
   SHA-256        : ce9623e1f58b46bc5e7485dffc6449d36255af5e9e2d877bb4db94e8c8b21ee7

   The model is used as an asset and redistributed under AGPLv3. This project
   does not copy ChaoxingSignFaker's Kotlin source. The inference pipeline in
   Server/internal/captcha is an independent Go implementation of the behavior
   described by ChaoxingCaptchaPredictor.kt (640x640 input, score 0.25, NMS IoU
   0.45, edge offset 4).

2. github.com/yalue/onnxruntime_go

   License        : MIT
   Usage          : Go binding that loads ONNX Runtime; not vendored.
   Deployment     : requires a compatible libonnxruntime shared library, see
                    DEPLOY.md.

Test fixtures
=============

Server/internal/captcha/testdata contains anonymous slider-captcha background
images captured from the public captcha endpoint. They contain no account id,
token, cookie, or other user data, and are used only as regression fixtures.
